Extractor state appends every tool call to `state.lastToolCalls`, but this array is never read and is never bounded/cleared. In long sessions this becomes unbounded growth for no benefit. Either remove `lastToolCalls` entirely or cap it to a small size if it’s intended for future heuristics.
```suggestion
    state.lastToolCalls.push({ tool, input })
    // Cap the size of lastToolCalls to avoid unbounded growth
    const MAX_LAST_TOOL_CALLS = 50
    if (state.lastToolCalls.length > MAX_LAST_TOOL_CALLS) {
      state.lastToolCalls.splice(0, state.lastToolCalls.length - MAX_LAST_TOOL_CALLS)
    }
```

